    <detaileddescription>
<para>A per-model placement hint. Sparse: list only the models you have an opinion about; anything absent means <computeroutput>MemoryPlacement_Auto</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>A hint, never a command. A host that cannot honour it downgrades and reports what it did — read <computeroutput>LoadModelResponse</computeroutput> rather than assuming. </para>
